C Sort Example
 Illustrates use of assembly instructions 
for a C bubble sort function
 Swap procedure (leaf)
void swap(long long int v[],
long long int k)
{
long long int temp;
temp = v[k];
v[k] = v[k+1];
v[k+1] = temp;
}
 v in x10, k in x11, temp in x5
