The Sort Procedure in C
 Non-leaf (calls swap)
void sort (long long int v[], size_t n)
{
size_t i, j;
for (i = 0; i < n; i += 1) {
for (j = i – 1;
j >= 0 && v[j] > v[j + 1];
j -= 1) {
swap(v,j);
}
}
}
 v in x10, n in x11, i in x19, j in x20

